## History

The project has been developed continuously by the same authors under three
successive names:

  CoCoA  Covid Collaborative Analysis, 2020
         started during the Covid Hackathon of April 2020
         https://github.com/tjbtjbtjb/CoCoA (public, archived)
  PyCoA  Python COVID Analysis, 2020–2023
         https://github.com/coa-project/pycoa (no longer public)
  pyvoa  Python Virus Open Analysis, since 2023
         developed in a branch of the PyCoA repository until March 2025
         https://github.com/pyvoa/pyvoa

Earlier contributions are recorded in the git histories of those repositories.
CHANGELOG.md summarises the CoCoA and PyCoA phases of the project and provides
a public account of its development during the PyCoA years.

