the French State under the « Investissements d'avenir » programme [grant number
ANR-18-IDEX-0001]; and by the « Institut Covid-19 Ad Memoriam » of Université
Paris Cité.

Institut Covid-19 Ad Memoriam: https://institut-ad-memoriam.u-pariscite.fr/

The pyvoa team is required to acknowledge both funding sources in its
publications, presentations, posters and other project materials.

Users who reuse pyvoa or publish results obtained with it are not required
to acknowledge these funding sources.
